	)
	(text "Probe is baised on work done by the Marco Carminati and Paolo Luzzatto-Fegiz. \nConduino CC-BY-SA 4.0 (https://github.com/feslab/conduino). As modified \nby the OpenCPD team CC-BY-SA 4.0 (Conduino-V01.pdf).\n\nPCB design development baised on the DFRobot Gravity EC Sensor DFR0300"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 184.658 173.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89d60d16-ab75-4935-85f3-8d74902876fe")
	)
	(text "The range is determined by feedback resistor R10. R12 will have very little effect.\n\nIf you want it to be less sensitive (higher conductivity) then you would reduce R10 proportionally. \n\nhttps://electronics.stackexchange.com/questions/695895/modifying-a-tds-module-for-higher-electrical-conductivity-measurements"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.002 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e942a3d-b3cb-45f6-872c-43899a7f7853")
	)
